@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Reference / reusable template. Illustrative contract/model/pattern, not a product release commitment.
title Template example — Publication revision lifecycle and observation
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

[*] --> Candidate : validated exact snapshot + explicit intent
Candidate --> Committed : guarded coherent commit
Candidate --> Rejected : denied / conflict before commit
Candidate --> Reconciling : commit observation uncertain
Reconciling --> Committed : same command result confirms commit
Reconciling --> Rejected : authoritative no-commit result
Committed --> Retained : no longer live; identity unchanged
Retained --> [*] : end of modeled observation, not deletion
Rejected --> [*]
note right of Reconciling
 Candidate / Reconciling are operation knowledge,
 not persisted revision status values.
 No physical deletion or retention deadline allocated.
end note

@enduml
